          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ഉദ്ധരിക്കുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഉദ്ധരിക്കുക — uddharikkuka — \"to quote; to cite\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രഭാഷകൻ ഒരു കവിയുടെ വരികൾ ഉദ്ധരിച്ചു. prabhāṣakan oru kaviyuṭe varikaḷ uddhariccu. The speaker quoted a poet's lines."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ഉദ്ധരിച്ചു, uddhariccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun is ഉദ്ധരണി, a quotation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഉദ്ധരിക്കുക (uddharikkuka) is built from Sanskrit uddharaṇa, \"taking up, drawing out\" (Monier-Williams), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക: to quote is to draw words out of a book."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
